  "description": {
   "en": "Marianne, the second daughter of the Countess of Landfouria, is a prodigy who loves books. Her current problem is that her half-sister is shunning her (Is this the fate of the second daughter?). However, Marianne's natural cheerfulness gradually melts her sister's stubborn heart. Furthermore, the second prince she meets at the school takes an interest in her positive attitude toward life...?",
   "ja": "ランドフーリア伯爵家の次女マリアンヌは、本が大好きな天才少女。目下の悩みは、腹違いの姉から疎まれていること…。(次女の宿命なのか??）けれど、持ち前の明るさで姉の頑なな心を少しずつ溶かしていくマリアンヌ。さらに、学園で出会った第二王子からもその前向きな生き方に興味を持たれて…!?"
  },
